   "kind": "Simulation",
   "sub": "The Hodgkin–Huxley model: find the threshold and refractory period, and block Na⁺ or K⁺ channels as local anaesthetics and toxins do.",
   "note": "SciGradify Biology's simulation: the published 1952 equations for one patch of squid axon membrane, with no propagation or myelin. Human values differ in detail; the mechanism is the same.",
